# Rendered player guides. This repo is PUBLIC and serves the GitHub Pages
# portal, so a committed guide PDF is a free download and the Patreon gate
# stops meaning anything. Commit games/<slug>/guide/guide.md, upload the PDF.
*.pdf
games/*/guide/*.html

